     *
     * Fallback order:
     * 1. Shipping country dropdown (if visible)
     * 2. Billing country dropdown (if visible)
     * 3. Shipping address country from quote
     * 4. Billing address country from quote
     * 5. Legacy country_id from quote (backward compatibility)
     * 6. Store's default country (for checkouts without country selector)
